    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/ce7eadc5480219f14b436c5c45dbbd09.avif?t=1752969173\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On a spread of islands on the Pacific Ocean, you get yourself one, and you aim to be a farmer! It is a long way from home, but the corporate life is just not for you, not after what happened, not after all the years you lost in that life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you were only able to get an island in ruin, and you barely had enough cash to buy some seeds and see where you could take it from there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up to the challenge? let's find out! <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/44d9ebd959ca229f48e7b66f3b4f29ed.avif?t=1752969173\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>34+ different plants &amp;\u00a0</i>trees </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>35+ main quests</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Farm expansions</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Seasons</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Day night cycle</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Weather Effects</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>40+ Crafting recipes</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>10+ Buildings</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>5+ different animals</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>And so much more!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/97ac6c2198b739a2a379a87e215d21a7.avif?t=1752969173\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/8637e6587b3a4f4872f6abc81f9d6e37.poster.avif?t=1752969173\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/8637e6587b3a4f4872f6abc81f9d6e37.webm?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/8637e6587b3a4f4872f6abc81f9d6e37.mp4?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/1b6ba2020fc91aee3dd72b2d2ad33ad3.poster.avif?t=1752969173\" width=800 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/1b6ba2020fc91aee3dd72b2d2ad33ad3.webm?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/1b6ba2020fc91aee3dd72b2d2ad33ad3.mp4?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/2ffb84b04f9f12c1d4b0076ca16c028e.poster.avif?t=1752969173\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/2ffb84b04f9f12c1d4b0076ca16c028e.webm?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/2ffb84b04f9f12c1d4b0076ca16c028e.mp4?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/ce7eadc5480219f14b436c5c45dbbd09.avif?t=1752969173\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On a spread of islands on the Pacific Ocean, you get yourself one, and you aim to be a farmer! It is a long way from home, but the corporate life is just not for you, not after what happened, not after all the years you lost in that life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you were only able to get an island in ruin, and you barely had enough cash to buy some seeds and see where you could take it from there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up to the challenge? let's find out! <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/44d9ebd959ca229f48e7b66f3b4f29ed.avif?t=1752969173\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>34+ different plants &amp;\u00a0</i>trees </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>35+ main quests</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Farm expansions</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Seasons</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Day night cycle</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Weather Effects</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>40+ Crafting recipes</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>10+ Buildings</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>5+ different animals</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>And so much more!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/97ac6c2198b739a2a379a87e215d21a7.avif?t=1752969173\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/8637e6587b3a4f4872f6abc81f9d6e37.poster.avif?t=1752969173\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/8637e6587b3a4f4872f6abc81f9d6e37.webm?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/8637e6587b3a4f4872f6abc81f9d6e37.mp4?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/1b6ba2020fc91aee3dd72b2d2ad33ad3.poster.avif?t=1752969173\" width=800 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/1b6ba2020fc91aee3dd72b2d2ad33ad3.webm?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/1b6ba2020fc91aee3dd72b2d2ad33ad3.mp4?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/2ffb84b04f9f12c1d4b0076ca16c028e.poster.avif?t=1752969173\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/2ffb84b04f9f12c1d4b0076ca16c028e.webm?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/2ffb84b04f9f12c1d4b0076ca16c028e.mp4?t=1752969173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
